DESCRIPTION:The Masters - Round 1\nThursday 8 April 2027\n\n91st edition\
 n\nVenue: Augusta National Golf Club\nAddress: 2604 Washington Rd\, Augu
 sta\, GA 30904\, USA\nTournament: Thu 8 - Sun 11 April 2027\n\nNotes\nFi
 rst major of the year and the only one played at the same course every t
 ime. Rory McIlroy goes for a third straight green jacket\, which no one 
 has ever done - only Jack Nicklaus and Tiger Woods have won back-to-back
 .\\n\\nPar 72\, 7\,555 yards. Field of around 90\, cut to the top 50 and
  ties after 36 holes.\n\nTee times are confirmed in tournament week.
