 GA Frisco":geo:33.199722,-96.855556
DESCRIPTION:PGA Championship - Round 1\nThursday 20 May 2027\n\n109th edi
 tion\n\nVenue: Fields Ranch East\, PGA Frisco\nAddress: 3110 Panther Cre
 ek Pkwy\, Frisco\, TX 75033\, USA\nTournament: Thu 20 - Sun 23 May 2027\
 n\nNotes\nThe only all-professional major field. Debuts at PGA Frisco\, 
 the PGA of America's new home - the first men's major in Texas since the
  1969 US Open at Champions in Houston\, and the first PGA Championship t
 here since 1968.\\n\\nGil Hanse design\, par 72\, 7\,863 yards. Aaron Ra
 i defends after winning at Aronimink.\\n\\nChampionship week runs 17-23 
 May\; competitive rounds are the 20th to the 23rd.\n\nTee times are conf
 irmed in tournament week.
CATEGORIES:Golf Majors
