 \nVenue: Pebble Beach Golf Links\nAddress: 1700 17 Mile Dr\, Pebble Beac
 h\, CA 93953\, USA\nTournament: Thu 17 - Sun 20 June 2027\n\nNotes\nPebb
 le Beach hosts for a seventh time. Gary Woodland won the last one there 
