 \, Ireland
GEO:52.563889;-8.789722
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="Adare, Co. Limerick, V94
  W8WR, Ireland";X-APPLE-RADIUS=400;X-TITLE="The Golf Course at Adare Man
 or":geo:52.563889,-8.789722
DESCRIPTION:Ryder Cup - Day 1 - Foursomes & Four-balls\nFriday 17 Septemb
 er 2027\n\n46th edition\n\nVenue: The Golf Course at Adare Manor\nAddres
 s: Adare\, Co. Limerick\, V94 W8WR\, Ireland\nTournament: Fri 17 - Sun 1
 9 September 2027\n\nNotes\nEurope v the United States. First Ryder Cup i
 n Ireland since 2006 at the K Club\, and the 100th anniversary of the co
 ntest.\\n\\nLuke Donald captains Europe for a third straight time - the 
 first European to do so since Bernard Gallacher in the 1990s. Jim Furyk 
 captains the USA\, a second spell after 2018.\\n\\nThree days of matches
 : foursomes and four-balls on Friday and Saturday\, twelve singles on Su
 nday. Build-up days run Mon 13 to Thu 16 September.\\n\\nNo prize money 
 - the players are unpaid.\n\nTee times are confirmed in tournament week.
CATEGORIES:Golf Majors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
