 L\, UK
GEO:56.343;-2.803
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="West Sands Rd, St Andrew
 s KY16 9XL, UK";X-APPLE-RADIUS=400;X-TITLE="The Old Course, St Andrews":
 geo:56.343,-2.803
DESCRIPTION:The Open Championship - Round 1\nThursday 15 July 2027\n\n155
 th edition\n\nVenue: The Old Course\, St Andrews\nAddress: West Sands Rd
 \, St Andrews KY16 9XL\, UK\nTournament: Thu 15 - Sun 18 July 2027\n\nNo
 tes\nTHE HOME OF GOLF. St Andrews hosts for a record 31st time - the Old
  Course only comes round every five years or so\, so this is the one to 
 plan around.\\n\\nOldest of the four majors\, first played in 1860. Ryan
  Fox defends after Royal Birkdale. Cameron Smith won the last Open here\
 , the 150th in 2022.\\n\\nLinks golf\, so weather decides as much as the
  field does.\n\nTee times are confirmed in tournament week.
CATEGORIES:Golf Majors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
